try for each alignment file :
save.context=c("CpG","CHG","CHH"),read.context="none"

http://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/methylKit/functions/read.bismark-methods

These options will create three different files for each context, but read none of them. The you can read those files using "read" function.

Best,
Altuna

